flowchart TD
    A["Daemon starts<br/>Daemon::run()"]
    B["Connect to Docker<br/>(optional, ok if missing)"]
    C["iptables.setup()<br/>Create NATMAP chains + jumps"]
    D{State file exists?}
    E["state = DaemonState::default()"]
    F["Load state from<br/>/var/lib/natmap/state.json"]
    G["Flush ALL stale<br/>NATMAP iptables rules"]
    H["Deallocate ALL<br/>port reservations"]
    I["Reconcile Docker mappings<br/>- Skip dead containers<br/>- Rebind ports, retarget changed container IPs<br/>- Re-add iptables rules<br/>Docker down: install from persisted state"]
    J["Reconcile static DNATs<br/>- Bind ports<br/>- Install iptables rules"]
    K["Reconcile static SNATs<br/>- Install iptables rules<br/>(no port binding)"]
    L["Reconcile static Hairpins<br/>- Bind ports<br/>- Install iptables rules"]
    P["Reconcile policy routes<br/>- Install ip rule + route"]
    M["Spawn Docker maintenance task<br/>- Retry connect with capped backoff<br/>- Reload + resubscribe events when<br/>Docker appears or the stream ends"]
    N["Spawn SIGTERM handler"]
    O["Bind Unix socket<br/>Start API server"]

    A --> B --> C --> D
    D -->|no| E
    D -->|yes| F
    F --> G
    E --> G
    G --> H --> I --> J --> K --> L
    L --> P --> M --> N --> O

    style G fill:#f96,stroke:#333
    style H fill:#f96,stroke:#333
